<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18776" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀχρημ-άτιστος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μᾰ],
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, ἡμέρα ἀ.</span> a day
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>on which no public business
				was done,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.273e
			</span></i>, cf. Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Tim.</u>
				43
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>disused,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρέαπ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMag.Lond.</u>
					46.345
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> dub. sens.
			in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				2276
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> Astrol.,
				<i>unprofitable, bringing no advantage,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόποι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antioch.Astr.
				</span></i>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				8(3).106
			</span></i>; of planets, <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				5.8
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
